{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/php/login_logout/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"loginlogin_formphp\" style=\"position:relative;\">/login/login_form.php<a href=\"#loginlogin_formphp\" aria-label=\"loginlogin_formphp permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">$id</code> 와 <code class=\"language-text\">$pass</code> 값을 post로 login.php에 넘겨준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"php\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-php line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-php\"><span class=\"token php language-php\"><span class=\"token delimiter important\">&lt;?</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">session_start</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  @<span class=\"token function\">extract</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token variable\">$_GET</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  @<span class=\"token function\">extract</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token variable\">$_POST</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  @<span class=\"token function\">extract</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token variable\">$_SESSION<